      ],
      "observed": "Proof/control routes declare no-store and now run through repo-owned Netlify Function responses, but public evidence still includes low nonzero Age observations while Netlify reports Durable fwd=bypass and Edge fwd=miss. Cloudflare cache status is dynamic, so a Cloudflare cache rule alone is not sufficient evidence that the provider Age conflict is resolved.",
      "requiredOperatorAction": "Provide a proof-route implementation or provider setting that emits no nonzero Age on no-store proof/control responses, or record a later explicit human-approved bounded rationale that Netlify Durable fwd=bypass plus Edge fwd=miss with low Age is acceptable non-cache-hit evidence for this gate.",
